#: ../../source/docs/circle-mode.rst:5 26543e1b16f64f3e8e498d2bd1193c4e
msgid "Circle Mode"
msgstr "Circle 模式"

#: ../../source/docs/circle-mode.rst:7 fb589580a31048e398d1574a2703a53f
msgid ""
"Circle will orbit a point located :ref:`CIRCLE_RADIUS<CIRCLE_RADIUS>` "
"centimeters in front of the vehicle with the nose of the vehicle pointed at "
"the center."
msgstr ""
"Circle 模式将在飞行器正前方 :ref:`CIRCLE_RADIUS<CIRCLE_RADIUS>` 厘米处绕一个点飞行，飞行器机头始终朝向圆心。"

#: ../../source/docs/circle-mode.rst:12 b2177da17b1340e191193630f2346d99
msgid "The units are **centimeters**."
msgstr "单位为 **厘米**。"

#: ../../source/docs/circle-mode.rst:14 d39551b6affb462e90d5e24e0dac70fe
msgid ""
"Setting the :ref:`CIRCLE_RADIUS<CIRCLE_RADIUS>` to zero will cause the "
"copter to simply stay in place and slowly rotate (useful for panorama "
"shots)."
msgstr "将 :ref:`CIRCLE_RADIUS<CIRCLE_RADIUS>` 设置为零将使飞机保持原地并缓慢旋转（适用于全景拍摄）。"

#: ../../source/docs/circle-mode.rst:17 61576e40f83341be8cea24d926b63a95
msgid ""
"The speed of the vehicle (in deg/second) can be modified by changing the "
":ref:`CIRCLE_RATE<CIRCLE_RATE>` parameter.  A positive value means rotate "
"clockwise, a negative means counter clockwise.  The vehicle may not achieve "
"the desired rate if this requires the acceleration towards the center of the"
" circle to surpass the maximum acceleration held in the "
":ref:`WPNAV_ACCEL<WPNAV_ACCEL>` parameter (units are cm/s/s)."
msgstr ""
"飞行器的速度（单位：度/秒）可通过修改 :ref:`CIRCLE_RATE<CIRCLE_RATE>` "
"参数来调整。正值表示顺时针旋转，负值表示逆时针旋转。如果所需的速度要求飞向圆心的向心加速度超过 "
":ref:`WPNAV_ACCEL<WPNAV_ACCEL>` 参数中存储的最大加速度（单位：cm/s/s），飞行器可能无法达到期望速率。"

#: ../../source/docs/circle-mode.rst:24 b932272ec788484a8c5734af31e9c2a1
#, no-python-format
msgid ""
"The circle rate set above can be dynamically adjusted in flight by two "
"methods. The first is the use of RC Channel 6 if the :ref:`TUNE<TUNE>` "
"option is set to 39, allowing decreasing the rate 50% or increasing it by "
"100%, at the channel min and max. The other is by enabling the "
"``CIRCLE_CONTROL`` parameter to allow stick adjustment of radius and speed."
msgstr ""
"上述圆绕速率可通过两种方法在飞行中动态调整。第一种是将 :ref:`TUNE<TUNE>` 选项设为 39 后使用 RC 通道 "
"6，可在通道最小值和最大值处将速率分别减少 50% 或增加 100%。另一种是启用 ``CIRCLE_CONTROL`` "
"参数，允许通过摇杆调整半径和速度。"

#: ../../source/docs/circle-mode.rst:27 a54b0e57187a4002aab6f1b861580593
msgid "Circle Control Option"
msgstr "Circle 控制选项"

#: ../../source/docs/circle-mode.rst:29 37c628abe50d4a0f9e6f2d2e48095f34
msgid ""
"The :ref:`CIRCLE_OPTIONS<CIRCLE_OPTIONS>` bitmask parameter controls what "
"actions the pilot can adjust with his sticks and circle mode operation."
msgstr ""
":ref:`CIRCLE_OPTIONS<CIRCLE_OPTIONS>` 位掩码参数控制飞手可通过摇杆调整的操作以及 Circle 模式的运行方式。"

#: ../../source/docs/circle-mode.rst:31 d6a4334c81dd4abd9ce0d67d568b2a94
msgid ""
"When bit 0 is set of the :ref:`CIRCLE_OPTIONS<CIRCLE_OPTIONS>` parameter the"
" pilot can adjust circle's radius and angular velocity with the control "
"sticks:"
msgstr ""
"当 :ref:`CIRCLE_OPTIONS<CIRCLE_OPTIONS>` 参数的第 0 位被设置时，飞手可通过控制摇杆调整圆的半径和角速度："

#: ../../source/docs/circle-mode.rst:33 e018792c2d4647f39276f54ec050caee
msgid ""
"Pitch stick up (reducing RC pwm) reduces the radius until it reaches zero. "
"Think moving forward from an FPV perspective."
msgstr "俯仰摇杆向上推（减小 RC PWM）将减小半径直至为零。从 FPV 视角理解为向前移动。"

#: ../../source/docs/circle-mode.rst:34 55a5827d58e3473095eeff8d4b5a9a68
msgid ""
"Pitch stick down (increasing RC pwm) increases the radius. Think moving back"
" from an FPV perspective."
msgstr "俯仰摇杆向下拉（增大 RC PWM）将增大半径。从 FPV 视角理解为向后移动。"

#: ../../source/docs/circle-mode.rst:35 2b346f60c19649478ce4fb88af945854
msgid ""
"Roll stick right (think clockwise) will increase the speed while moving "
"clockwise, or decrease the speed while moving counterclockwise until "
"reaching zero, at which point it will stop."
msgstr "横滚摇杆向右（顺时针方向）将在顺时针移动时增加速度，或在逆时针移动时减小速度直至为零，此时飞机将停止。"

#: ../../source/docs/circle-mode.rst:36 6c554e5dfc91449ca26740284d102fa1
msgid ""
"Roll stick left (think counterclockwise) will increase the speed while "
"moving counterclockwise, or decrease the speed while moving clockwise until "
"reaching zero, at which point it will stop. Once stopped (rate 0), releasing"
" the roll stick and pushing it again in either direction will begin moving "
"again in the desired direction. So yes, this allows you to completely change"
" the direction on the fly."
msgstr ""
"横滚摇杆向左（逆时针方向）将在逆时针移动时增加速度，或在顺时针移动时减小速度直至为零，此时飞机将停止。一旦停止（速率为 "
"0），松开横滚摇杆后再向任意方向推动，飞机将重新朝该方向移动。因此，这允许您在飞行中完全改变绕行方向。"

#: ../../source/docs/circle-mode.rst:37 54dbc9d5c43943ab9ab9125da8101e49
msgid ""
"Roll stick rate changes are inhibited when CH6 tuning knob is set for circle"
" rate."
msgstr "当 CH6 调参旋钮设置为圆绕速率时，横滚摇杆的速率变化将被禁止。"

#: ../../source/docs/circle-mode.rst:38 845f6379449444d69c5b8cf7ad1e8873
msgid ""
"All stick changes are inhibited in radio failsafe.(ie if loiter turns was "
"part of a mission that continues when in failsafe)"
msgstr "在遥控器失控保护时所有摇杆变化均被禁止（即如果绕圈飞行是任务的一部分，且在失控保护时继续执行任务）。"

#: ../../source/docs/circle-mode.rst:39 230d3d09ddc1408eb22f551298049e2c
msgid ""
"The above does not actually change the stored circle_rate or circle_radius "
"parameter. Upon rebooting, any stick changes to rate and radius are gone and"
" it will use the parameter values. So users should not have any surprises "
"with every new flight."
msgstr ""
"上述操作实际上不会改变存储的 circle_rate 或 circle_radius "
"参数。重启后，通过摇杆对速率和半径所做的任何更改都将消失，系统将使用参数值。因此用户每次新飞行时不会遇到意外情况。"

#: ../../source/docs/circle-mode.rst:41 7939c97406894ed583a3176ab27ff952
msgid ""
"When bit 1 is set of the :ref:`CIRCLE_OPTIONS<CIRCLE_OPTIONS>` parameter the"
" Copter will face the direction of travel as it circles, otherwise, the "
"Copter will point its nose at the center of the circle as it orbits. When "
"bit 2 is set of the :ref:`CIRCLE_OPTIONS<CIRCLE_OPTIONS>` parameter the "
"circle's center position will set upon mode entry at the current location, "
"rather than on the perimeter with the center in front of the Copter at the "
"start. When bit 3 is set of the :ref:`CIRCLE_OPTIONS<CIRCLE_OPTIONS>` "
"parameter the mount's (if used) ROI aka region of interest will be set on "
"the circle center causing mount to face the circle's center all the times."
msgstr ""
"设置 :ref:`CIRCLE_OPTIONS<CIRCLE_OPTIONS>` 参数的位 1 后，Copter "
"绕圈时机头朝向行进方向；否则绕圈时机头指向圆心。设置 :ref:`CIRCLE_OPTIONS<CIRCLE_OPTIONS>` 参数的位 2 "
"后，圆心在进入模式时设在当前位置，而不是开始时载具位于圆周上、圆心在正前方。设置 "
":ref:`CIRCLE_OPTIONS<CIRCLE_OPTIONS>` 参数的位 3 后，云台（如有）的 "
"ROI（兴趣区域）会设在圆心，使云台始终朝向圆心。"

#: ../../source/docs/circle-mode.rst:46 52ff4314cec1428290fa928a0f630cd4
msgid "Other Notes"
msgstr "其他说明"

#: ../../source/docs/circle-mode.rst:48 5823832f952844ea918aa8de46c6307f
msgid ""
"The pilot does not have any control over the roll and pitch but can change "
"the altitude with the throttle stick as in :ref:`altholdmode` or "
":ref:`loiter-mode`."
msgstr ""
"飞手对横滚和俯仰没有控制权，但可以像在 :ref:`altholdmode` 或 :ref:`loiter-mode` 中一样通过油门摇杆改变高度。"

#: ../../source/docs/circle-mode.rst:50 739db0dbe43240458d6f2f3ba03e6f3f
msgid ""
"The pilot can control the yaw of the copter, but the autopilot will not "
"retake control of the yaw until circle mode is re-engaged."
msgstr "飞手可以控制飞机的偏航，但飞控在 Circle 模式重新激活之前不会重新接管偏航控制。"

#: ../../source/docs/circle-mode.rst:52 0e08f050c9d044df8371582befb1e110
msgid ""
"If the Rover cannot maintain a track close the  circle desired it will "
"automatically decrease speed until it can maintain the desired track."
msgstr "如果 Rover 无法保持接近期望圆的轨迹，它将自动降低速度直到能够保持所需轨迹。"

#: ../../source/docs/circle-mode.rst:54 010287f8d2454e2e83a0e67f42dca3bb
msgid ""
"The mission command ``LOITER_TURNS`` invokes Circle mode during a mission."
msgstr "任务指令 ``LOITER_TURNS`` 在任务执行过程中会触发 Circle 模式。"
